sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pres as Presenter
    participant Dash as Dashboard
    actor Aud as Audience
    Pres->>Dash: Open Validation tab
    Dash-->>Aud: MAE, RMSE, MAPE on healthy data
    Dash-->>Aud: Confusion matrix and detection delay
    Dash-->>Aud: False-alarm rate
    Pres->>Dash: Export CSV and report
